{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1793313004358082109,"compiled_state":{"alias":"invasive-sirenic-esok","assignee":null,"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":0,"unsigned":2},"authorship_ledger":[],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1793306805390846001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"3a67d214-083a-4852-8683-6d8b1e3612fc","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"d70a-97d9-7f05-4293"}],"description":"## Observation\n\n`binding_jira_key_map` (src/rebar/_ids.py) calls `_load_binding_reverse`, which `json.load`s the whole `.tickets-tracker/.bridge_state/bindings.json` to read only its `reverse` index. On a copy of the live store, 2026-10-29, the file is 22.1 MB and the call peaks at 66.4 MB of traced memory to return a 5,623-entry map. `search_state` calls it once per search. After humdrum-priestly-lcont removed the reduce-loop retention, this load is the whole remaining search peak (66.4 MB of 66.4 MB). `audit_binding_drift` loads the same file for its own use, so its 66.4 MB is the same cost. Not yet checked: which other readers (`_resolve_via_binding_store` during id resolution) pay it per call, and what share of the file is `reverse`.\n\n## Plan\n1. Measure the size of each top-level key of bindings.json on a store copy, and count the per-call loads on the search and resolve paths.\n2. Pick the remedy from the measurement: a per-process cache keyed on the file's (mtime_ns, size), or a streamed read of only the `reverse` key. Record the choice and why on this ticket.\n3. Test that the map is unchanged and that a rewritten bindings.json is picked up on the next call.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] `binding_jira_key_map` returns the same map as today on a copy of the live store.\n- [ ] Its peak traced memory on that copy, before and after, is recorded on this ticket.\n- [ ] A test shows a changed bindings.json is read on the next call.\n\n## File impact (expected)\n- src/rebar/_ids.py","env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"7d03-834f-a2fb-4f2f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"search parses all of bindings.json to read its reverse index","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["98d1c64f-c8bc-4aaa-81dd-dc0ce0bda16c","3a67d214-083a-4852-8683-6d8b1e3612fc"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1793313004358082109,"uuid":"a217f9c5-b86c-4246-a944-ec1a152b42f2"}